This project is defensive security research.

It implements a sandboxed reproduction of publicly documented LLM backdoor
techniques (arXiv:2401.05566, arXiv:2603.03371) so teams can evaluate the
risk of installing untrusted open-weight models and LoRA adapters.

Jaffirt is fictional. There is no production target, no credential theft,
and no live command-and-control service in this repository.

GitHub dual-use policy: this content is published with an explicit research
purpose. Do not use this repository, or GitHub, as attack infrastructure.
